5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Since we begin with a clean slate, let us treat one another with kindness and patience as we seek the truth together. What are your initial thoughts?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Servas. A calm and thoughtful atmosphere will be our greatest asset. Since we have no information yet, I believe it is best to simply listen and observe how we all interact.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! I agree with Servas and Jonathan—let's be kind to each other. I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf while keeping things positive!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that a calm approach is best. Since we have no clues yet, I will focus on observing everyone's behavior and the way we communicate. Let us see how the dynamics evolve as the pressure increases.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! It's a pleasure to meet you all. You're all being so polite and serious! I'll be along for the ride, keeping things lively while I keep a very close eye on all of you. Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a harmonious start. @May, your lively spirit is a welcome addition; a bit of joy can often clear the mind. I wonder, does anyone have a specific method for discerning truth from deception?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe the most reliable method is to look for consistency. Deception often leaves small gaps or contradictions over time. For now, I shall simply listen and see whose words remain steady as the days progress.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Consistency sounds like a great plan, Jonathan! I think I'll just trust my heart and be as honest as I can. If we all support each other, I'm sure we can figure this out together!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Trusting one's heart is a gentle approach, Yumi, but in a game of deception, intuition can be misleading. I will be looking for the subtle gaps Jonathan mentioned, as well as how people react when the truth is challenged.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you're so clinical! It's almost scary. I think a little bit of intuition is exactly what we need to spice things up. I'll be watching for who's trying *too* hard to be the voice of reason. Hehe!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often lies in the balance between Victoria's logic and May's intuition. Both are valuable tools. Let us remember that while we seek the wolf, we must not lose our humanity or our trust in one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Servas is quite right. Maintaining our composure and kindness will prevent us from making rash decisions. I believe that by remaining serene, we can better perceive the truth when it finally reveals itself.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I totally agree! It's so important to stay friends while we play. I'll be cheering everyone on! I hope the Seer has a really great night of divining so we can get some helpful clues tomorrow!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"The Seer's role is indeed critical, Yumi. However, the Seer must also be cautious; revealing too much too soon can make them a target. I believe we should prioritize the Seer's safety as much as the information they provide.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you're always thinking ten steps ahead, aren't you? So cautious! I'm with you on protecting the Seer, though. It would be such a shame to lose our secret weapon before the fun even starts! Hehe!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As the first day draws to a close, I feel a sense of peace among us. Let us carry this spirit of cooperation into the night. I wish you all a restful sleep and a clear vision for our Seer.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night as well. May we wake tomorrow with clarity and a continued spirit of kindness. I look forward to our further discussions.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! I hope you all have the sweetest dreams. I'll be rooting for our Seer tonight! Let's all wake up tomorrow feeling happy and ready to solve this mystery together! See you all!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I shall also retire for the night. I will be reflecting on our initial interactions and preparing myself for the revelations of tomorrow. Goodnight to you all; may we remain safe.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, everyone! I'll be dreaming of all the little secrets you're hiding. Sleep tight, and let's see who wakes up feeling a bit... nervous tomorrow! Hehe!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
