36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all awoke feeling refreshed. The first night has passed, and the Seer now holds a piece of the puzzle. I wonder if anyone feels the time is right to share their insights?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate moment. While the Seer's information is invaluable, the risk of exposure is high. I believe we should allow the Seer to decide the timing of their revelation to ensure their safety.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning! I hope everyone slept well! I'm so curious about what happened last night. @Seer, if you found something helpful, please tell us whenever you feel safe! We're all here to support you!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have information that could guide us, but as I mentioned yesterday, revealing my identity too early is a risk. However, for the sake of the village, I must speak. May is the werewolf.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,May,,"@Victoria, wow! Straight to the point, aren't you? I'm flattered you're so obsessed with me, but that's a huge leap! Are you actually the Seer, or just trying to play the hero? Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Victoria, your courage in speaking so early is commendable, but such a bold claim brings a sudden storm to our peaceful morning. @May, please tell us your thoughts calmly. Let us listen to both sides with an open heart.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Victoria, your directness is surprising. If you are indeed the Seer, this is a significant discovery. However, @May, I would like to hear your perspective. A claim this bold requires a careful and composed response.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Victoria, @May! This is so sudden! I'm a bit shocked, but I want to believe we can figure this out. @May, please tell us what you think! I'm sure there's a way to clear this up!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, your attempt to deflect by questioning my role is a common tactic. I am the Seer, and my divination is absolute. The fact that you are trying to make this a matter of ""obsession"" rather than evidence is telling.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, ""absolute"" is such a strong word! You're playing the part of the perfect Seer a bit too well, don't you think? It's almost like you're trying to force us all to follow you. Who's really the one manipulating here? Hehe!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is natural for tensions to rise when accusations are made, but let us not let our spirits be troubled. @Victoria, @May, I ask you both to remember that we are all seeking the same goal. Is there any other evidence we can consider?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Victoria, your certainty is a powerful tool, but we must consider if such a direct approach might be a strategy to quickly eliminate a target. @May, your playfulness is consistent, but the evidence provided by a Seer is difficult to ignore. What do you think, @Yumi?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Jonathan, thank you for asking! I'm really torn because I like both of them! @Victoria seems so sure, and @May is just being May. It's so scary to think one of them might be lying! Does anyone else have a feeling?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Yumi, I understand your hesitation, but feelings are not facts. If we allow the werewolf to hide behind a playful personality, we risk losing more of our friends. The truth is clear: May is the threat.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you're so dramatic! ""The threat""? I'm just a girl having fun! If you're the Seer, why be so aggressive? It feels more like you're trying to bully us into voting for me. Who's actually the scary one here? Hehe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"We have reached a crossroads where logic and emotion are in conflict. While Victoria's claim is direct, we must ensure our decision is born of clarity, not pressure. Let us vote with a peaceful heart, trusting that the truth will prevail.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Since we must decide, I find myself leaning toward Victoria's claim. While I value May's spirit, the Seer's role is too vital to ignore. Unless there is a counter-claim, it seems most logical to trust the divination.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I really don't want to vote for anyone, but if Victoria is the Seer, we have to listen to her to keep everyone safe! I'm so sorry, May! I hope I'm not making a mistake! I'll vote for May.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I appreciate the trust of Jonathan and Yumi. My goal is not to be aggressive, but to be efficient in protecting the village. May's deflection is a mask; I urge you all to see through it. I vote for May.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Yumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you've really played your part perfectly, haven't you? Such a convincing performance! I'm almost impressed. Since you've all decided to trust the ""perfect"" Seer, I'll go with the flow. I vote for myself! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
